  <h1>JORDAN REPOSITORY</h1>
  <h2>Current Version: 1.0</h2>
  <p>Instructions for adding this repo:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Go to Kodi file manager.</li>
    <li>Click on "Add Source".</li>
    <li>The address for the source is <code>https://aquatojl.github.io/</code> (name it "JORDAN Repo").</li>
    <li>Go to "Addons".</li>
    <li>Select "Install from zip file", choose "JORDAN Repo", and install
      <a href="repository.jordan-1.0.zip">repository.jordan-1.0.zip</a>.
    </li>
    <li>Go back to Addons and select "Install from repository".</li>
    <li>Select the "Jordan Repository".</li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>Now the rest is your choice!</strong></p>
  <h2>Enjoy!</h2>
</body>
